    directAnswer: "CrossFit gym design is the engineering of high-intensity functional training floors with impact-absorbing platforms, anchored rigs, and heavy-duty ventilation. It covers structural design for dropped-bar impact loads, rig anchorage engineering, acoustic control for an intense environment, and the HVAC that keeps a hard-working box breathable.",
